# 文本一律以 LF 入库、以 LF 检出——不随 core.autocrlf 走（Git for Windows 默认 true，
# 会把工作区改成 CRLF，解析器、快照契约与跨平台测试都按 LF 写）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe 的批处理要 CRLF（LF 下标签 / GOTO 会错位）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做换行转换、不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
